  <div class="profile-bio">
    <p>I am currently an Assistant Professor in the <a href="https://stat.illinois.edu">Department of Statistics</a> at the University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign.</p>
    <p>Before joining the University of Illinois, I was a postdoctoral researcher at Rice University, advised by Prof. <a href="https://profiles.rice.edu/faculty/genevera-allen">Genevera Allen</a>. I completed my Ph.D. in the <a href="https://stat.wisc.edu">Department of Statistics at the University of Wisconsin-Madison</a>, under the supervision of Prof. <a href="http://pages.cs.wisc.edu/~raskutti/">Garvesh Raskutti</a>. I received my bachelor's degree at the <a href="https://en.ustc.edu.cn">University of Science and Technology of China (USTC)</a> in 2016.</p>
  </div>
